{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52254","headline":"诗（幷序） 十五 · 王梵志","name":"诗（幷序） 十五","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"独自心中骤，四面被兵围。\n向前十道捝（张改「税」，戴、蒋校「挽」，黄校「棁」），背後铁鎚鎚。\n伺命张弓射，苦痛剧刀锥。\n使者门前唤，忙怕不容（一作「客」）迟。\n倮（张校作「裸」）体逐他走，浑舍共号悲。\n宅舍无人护，妻子被人欺。\n钱财不关己，庄（郭校「藏」）收永长离。\n三魂无倚住，七魄散头飞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王梵志","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52254.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52254","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}